direction: right
Workload: Application workload {shape: rectangle}
Identity: Workload identity {shape: rectangle}
Vault: Secrets manager {shape: cylinder}
Policy: Access policy {shape: document}
Database: Protected database {shape: cylinder}
Rotator: Rotation job {shape: rectangle}
Audit: Audit stream {shape: queue}
Workload -> Identity: attest
Identity -> Vault: authenticated request
Policy -> Vault: permissions
Vault -> Workload: short-lived credential
Workload -> Database
Rotator -> Database: change credential
Rotator -> Vault: publish new version
Vault -> Audit
Rotator -> Audit
